                                                                                                                   \
  1. History stacking \'97 change obs_dim to 12 * K (K=3), keep a rolling buffer in the env. This directly addresses  \
  the critique's biggest complaint about architecture.                                                             \
  2. Better progress reward \'97 replace \uc0\u8722 0.01 * ||pos - gate_center|| with the Northlake insight: reward based on    \
  velocity projection along gate approach direction. Prevents the oscillation hack, gives cleaner gradient.        \
  3. Clip radius curriculum schedule \'97 the critique calls this out explicitly. Add a concrete ramp tied to\
  gates_passed or training step to env.clip_radius. Right now it's static.                                         \
